Package: ecoTemporalNet
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Temporal Overlap Networks in Ecology
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aji", "John", email = "ajijohn@uw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for building and analyzing directed interval-overlap
    networks in ecology using first and last day-of-year observations.
    The package includes functions for overlap detection, network
    construction, persistence metrics, and temporal summary statistics.
